hat stands off the base a little bit. Might incorporate the ribbon cable as a design element. It had the correct connector already. 😀 t.co</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1022764254573809664-DjGVUzGUYAABv_3.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1022764254573809664</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1022764254573809664\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2018-07-27T08:42:54Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1022785678457884673":{"a":"<p>Probably the batteries.  Changing them will probably put out the fire. <a href=\"https://x.com/HarlanCoben/status/1022508776484687872\">Tweet by @HarlanCoben</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/HarlanCoben/status/1022508776484687872\">https://x.com/HarlanCoben/status/1022508776484687872</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1022785678457884673</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1022785678457884673\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2018-07-27T10:08:02Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1022956005267857408":{"a":"<p>#Humanity needs a #Middleway 🙏</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/20360014\">patreon.com/posts/20360014</a> t.co</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1022956005267857408-DjJExaNU0AAUwp9.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1022956005267857408</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1022956005267857408\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2018-07-27T21:24:51Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"}}